• Shape your team vision, contribute to scope and quarterly OKRs with Product and other functions, and be accountable for turning initiatives into valuable, adopted outcomes

• Own delivery for your team: plan execution, spot dependencies and manage risks early, clear obstacles and drive impact

• Align stakeholders across domains and functions, including partner engineering teams, Product, Design, Analytics, Finance, Tax and external tax vendors, balancing compliance requirements, product priorities and engineering capacity

• Grow your people through real 1:1s, development plans, coaching, performance management and feedback

• Contribute to the domain's technical strategy and set your team's technical direction, keeping a high bar for resilience, scalability, quality and developer experience

• Lead how your team uses AI and modern tooling across planning, building, testing and running software, focusing on what saves time and effort or raises quality

• Work with other engineering leaders to improve how we build software across the organization.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

